tial prefix is proved.','No claim that rejecting a real heartbeat response is required: no-response and negative-response are different contexts.']}\njson.dump(p,open('contact-check-plan.json','w'),indent=2)\nsub={'action':'check','unit_id':r['units'][0]['id'],'rationale':'Execute the accepted conditional lease obligation using the previously explored actual producer/consumer code. The independent oracle is the no-contact lease contract, not equality between scenarios. Correlate prefix, completion and lease result by operation; include ordinary timeout as a permitted comparison path. Retain conditional initialization and omitted-worker scope.','plan_path':'contact-check-plan.json','harness_path':'contact_timeout_check_test.go','files':{}}\njson.dump(sub,open('submission-check.json','w'),indent=2)\nimport jsonschema,copy\njsonschema.validate(sub,json.load(open('../native-submission.schema.json')))\nv=copy.deepcopy(p);v['harness']['source']=s\njsonschema.validate(v,json.load(open('../product-schemas.json'))['DirectCheckPlan'])\nprint('Submission and capture-populated plan validate; submitted harness source/files are empty for controller capture.')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
